==== help ====
~~~~ 80x24 ~~~~

  ␛[1;94mKeys␛[m
  Enter        send, or queue while a turn runs
  Shift-Enter  new line (also Alt-Enter, Ctrl-J)
  Ctrl-C       cancel the turn; again to exit
  Ctrl-D       exit (empty input)
  Tab          complete a /command or an /image path; on empty input, focus
               waiting approvals and queued messages
  Up/Down      recall earlier messages
  Ctrl-O       open the last tool's full output
  PgUp/PgDn    scroll the messages; End follows new ones
  F1           show this help

  ␛[1;94mCommands␛[m
  /approve     open the waiting approvals and questions
  /copy        copy the last reply to the clipboard
  /drop        delete the last queued message
  /exit        exit; the session stays in Dex
  /help        list keys and commands
  /history     read earlier messages of this session
␛[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────␛[m
